解你的感受。你说有时候挺难受，那种难受通常在什么时候出现？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":3014,"promptTokens":594,"completionTokens":120,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 16:30:00"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":9,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.02296641935351492,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af6ca88f4429d1fd72fc756","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794558600308,"createTime":"2026-11-13 16:30:00","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6ca88f4429d1fd72fc756","chatId":"0ff04a07b4ed4b3ca143a4e96c524321","sessionId":null,"userId":100197,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"嗯……“安全”是什么意思啊？我有点搞不懂。反正就是……有时候觉得挺难受的，但我也说不上来为什么。你会不会觉得我爸妈不好？<第4轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":8,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.02296641935351492,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af6ca88f4429d1fd72fc757","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794558600305,"createTime":"2026-11-13 16:30:00","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6ca81f4429d1fd72fc750","chatId":"0ff04a07b4ed4b3ca143a4e96c524321","sessionId":null,"userId":100197,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"我不会随便告诉你爸妈，谈话内容基本是保密的；只有涉及你或别人的安全时，我才会需要联系相关的人。说不清楚也没关系，我们可以慢慢来。最近有没有什么感觉，让你觉得“不太对劲”？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"我不会随便告诉你爸妈，谈话内容基本是保密的；只有涉及你或别人的安全时，我才会需要联系相关的人。说不清楚也没关系，我们可以慢慢来。最近有没有什么感觉，让你觉得“不太对劲”？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2259,"promptTokens":472,"completionTokens":169,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 16:29:53"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":7,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005909372166809778,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af6ca81f4429d1fd72fc74f","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794558593231,"createTime":"2026-11-13 16:29:53","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6ca81f4429d1fd72fc74f","chatId":"0ff04a07b4ed4b3ca143a4e96c524321","sessionId":null,"userId":100197,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"哦……那，我说的话你会告诉我爸妈吗？我就是有点担心这个。还有，我也不知道自己到底怎么了，说不太清楚。<第3轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":6,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005909372166809778,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af6ca81f4429d1fd72fc750","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794558593228,"createTime":"2026-11-13 16:29:53","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6ca7cf4429d1fd72fc74a","chatId":"0ff04a07b4ed4b3ca143a4e96c524321","sessionId":null,"userId":100197,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"聊天是一部分，但更像是一起看看你卡在哪儿、那些感受是怎么来的。你不确定要不要说，这很正常，我们可以只聊你愿意说的部分。你担心说出来之后会发生什么吗？","optio